<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand bill auction results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand bill auction results.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced</p>
<p>the following results for its bills issue on Friday:</p>
<p>    MATURITY  TENDER AMT   ALLOTED AMT    AVG YIELD  RANGE</p>
<p>		  (MLNS BAHT)  (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    30 days    4,850	  2,000	  10.95    10.61-11.10</p>
<p>    2 years    1,545	    500	  10.03     9.08-10.45</p>
<p>NOTE: Two year bond has a 10 percent coupon rate per year. ($1 = 26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
